    Your friend <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Thomas</span> walks ahead of you. Shoulders low, hands in pockets, and his eyes glancing downward towards the ground. It’s how he normally walks. His way of telling the world that he does not want to talk to them. To be fair, it works, as most other kids ignore him or steer clear. You know he isn’t really a bad kid, but his reputation is one of a punk kid who isn’t afraid to throw hands. <span style="color:LightGreen">Though despite this, you are still friends, or close enough.</span> So, as you see your friend walking down the hallway all by his lonesome, a devious thought enters your brain. One that may not be the BEST idea, but is still an interesting one. <span style="color:Pink">You were going to give him a surprise friendly wedgie. What could go wrong?</span> <br>
     
