    <span style="color:Pink">You grip <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Thomas</span>’ $ThomasUndies.Name and yank them halfway up his back! The boy makes a noise of surprise and instantly straightens up. You get out a single chuckle as you tug your friend’s underwear</span> <span style="color:Yellow">before a feeling hits the back of your gut. You’re in danger. Suddenly, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Thomas</span> swings around, fist drawn, and-</span> <br>
